flowchart LR
    Input[External / Internal Input] --> Validate[Validation]
    Validate --> Agent[Agent]
    Agent --> Capability[Capability]
    Capability --> Policy[Policy + Authorization]
    Policy --> Risk[Risk Classification]
    Risk --> Approval{Human Approval?}
    Approval -->|No| Tool[Tool Contract]
    Approval -->|Yes| Human[Human Approval]
    Human --> Tool
    Tool --> Connector[Connector]
    Connector --> Provider[Provider]
    Provider --> External[External System]
    External --> Observe[Observation]
    Observe --> Result[Validated Result]
    Result --> Audit[Audit / Provenance]
